  "brief_en": "Use the supplied Waypoint source-ui HTML files, screenshots and workflow.json. Recreate their UI as editable React elements and animate the workflow: create a Lisbon trip, add a museum, move the museum to day 2, share the plan. Use an intentional camera/cursor to explain each action. Deliver a 30-second demo. Do not replace the workflow with unrelated marketing slides.",
